      "**Causality Criterion:** $x(t) = 0 \\; \\forall t < 0$ (CT) and $x[n] = 0 \\; \\forall n < 0$ (DT).",
      "**Even Parity Criterion:** $x(-t) = x(t)$ and $x[-n] = x[n]$.",
      "**Odd Parity Criterion:** $x(-t) = -x(t)$ and $x[-n] = -x[n]$, with $x(0) = 0, x[0] = 0$.",
      "**CT Periodicity Criterion for Sums:** All $\\frac{T_i}{T_j} \\in \\mathbb{Q}$.",
      "**DT Periodicity Criterion:** $\\frac{\\Omega_0}{2\\pi} = \\frac{m}{N_0} \\in \\mathbb{Q}$."
